  <p class="last-updated">Last updated: April 28, 2026</p>

  <div class="highlight-box">
    <strong>Short version:</strong> Use RateKit freely for personal and business purposes. Our calculators are for informational purposes only — always verify important financial decisions with a qualified professional.
