  <h2>13. Third-Party API Keys</h2>
  <p>Certain features of RateKit (such as Deal Coach) allow you to connect a third-party API key (e.g. Anthropic Claude API) to enable AI-powered functionality. Regarding these keys:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>We never store your API key on our servers.</strong> Keys are stored exclusively in your browser's localStorage and are never transmitted to RateKit's servers.</li>
